      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13010/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in broth, then add in tomatillos, tomatoes, and chiles. Stir together and season with oregano, coriander, and cumin. Bring to a boil, then simmer for 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HHRI-z0A6EDUfMIt5oWEPFO7roU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13010-white-bean-chicken-chili-ddmfs-step3-056-4x3-e07530d7d3a9418e885d668d6144b825.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13010/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add chicken, beans, and corn; simmer 5 minutes. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
